<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zechariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zechariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia kumpilianpa Darius maan zawk a kum niina, a tha liat tha sungah Topa in Iddo tupa, Berechiah tapa kamsaangpa Zechariah tungah hi thu pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in mipite tungah hi thu a son tu in Zechariah sawl a, “Na taanghpupite tungah keima, Topa ka thin uuk mama hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahihang tu in no tungah kong ci hi, ‘Kei kungah hong heakkik tavun, tuaciang keima no sangah kong kiheak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na taanghpupite taw kibang nawn heak vun. Khuangeipi lai in kamsaangte in amate kungah ka thupuak sonin, ngamtat sia, mawna taw a nuntak nawn ngawl natu in thuhil uh hi. Ahihang amate in ka thu hong ngai nuam ngawlin hong mang nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na taanghpupite le tua kamsaangte nungta nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na taanghpupite tungah ka naseam kamsaangte tungtawnin thupiaknate le kidop natu thute ka pia hi, ahihang amate in tuate thusim ngawl a, a ngamtatna taw a kizui in ngimna thuak uh hi. Tuasia ciang amate kisiik kikin, keima, a Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate taw a kiphu bang le ka sep tu tatak a ka khensat bangin daan ka piak hunlam hong tel uh hi,’ ” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darius sia kumpilianpa in a maan zawk a kum niina, a tha sawm le tha khatna (Shebat tha), ni 24 ni zanin Topa in mukholna khat sungah thupuak khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siphu san khat tungah a to khat ka mu hi. Ama sia myrtle thingkung pawlkhat kawm, kuam sung khat ah tawlnga a, ama nungsangah siphu dangte — a san, a pawl tiptep le a kaangte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ka dongh a, “Topa awng, hi siphute in bang khiakna nei ziam?” ka ci hi. Ama in, “Bang ci nuam ziam kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in tuate leitung a enkot tu in paisak hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tua vantunglalang tungah: “Leitung theampo ah pai zo ung, leitung buppi sia a cimaw, a kizo sa in om hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantunglalang in, “Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng, Jerusalem tung le Judah ngam khuapite tungah kum sawmsali sung thin uuk zo ni hi. Amate na hesuak tu bang tanvei hai lai tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in heenepna kammal taw vantunglalang tungah zo kik a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciangin hi Vaanglianbelpa Topa pauna thangsak tu in vantunglalang in kei hong sawl hi: “Ka khuapi thiangtho Jerusalem atu in thinbotna le itna thukpi ka nei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang kilemna le ngamdaina a nga minamte tungah ka thin uuk mama hi. Banghang ziam cile ka mite tungah ka thin uukna iip kenkonin ka om laitak tua minamte in ka mite thuakna nasiasak seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jerusalem khuapi tungah ka hesuakna lak tu in kong pai kik zo hi. Ka Biakinnpi kipua pha kik tu a, khuapi kisa kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vantunglalang in Topa kammal hi teng zongh thangsak tu in hong sawl hi: “Vaanglianbelpa Topa in a khuapite nuamsa kik tu a, ama in Jerusalem khatvei hu kikin, ama khuapi in nei kik tu hi, ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mukholna dang sungah khuital kii li ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima hong paupui vantunglalang tungah, “Hi sakiite a khiakna bang ziam,” ci in ka dongh hi. Ama in, “Tuate in Judah, Israel le Jerusalem mite a kithethaangsak simlei vaangliante a cinopna ahi hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in sek veu a toai naseam pasal li hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in, “Hi mite bang vawt tu in hong pai ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi. Topa in, “Amate in Judah ngam suthamin a mite a thethaangsak minamte a lausak tu le a lawnthal tu in hong pai hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mukholna dang khat ah a khut sungah piteena khau a toai pasal khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Koisung pai tu ni ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi. Ama in, “Jerusalem bangza in sau a, bangza in zai ziam, ci in tee tu khi hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang keima hong paupui vantunglalang sia mai sangah kal hong suan ka mu a, vantunglalang dang khat ama taw kisi tu in hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A masa sia in a dang khat sia munah, “Zia sung a pikhau toai khangmoipa kungah va tai ta'n a, Jerusalem ah mihing le ngannote tam leilam tu ahiciang luphung taw uum tu in lian lei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in khuapi huu tu in ama mama khuapi kiimkot a mei luphung khat hi tu a, ama tua munah a vaangletna theampo taw a teang tu in kamciam pia zo hi va ci ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Mun theampo ah note kong thethaang hi. Ahihang tu in, no saltaangte awng, Babylon panin suakta in Jerusalem ah heak kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khat pawpo in note hong saat le, kei a tu manphabel ka sak sia a saat ahi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Vaanglianbelpa Topa in a mite ii vanh a suttol minamte tungah hi thu son tu in keima hong puak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Topa ama mama in note hong sim tu a, khatvei lai a na naseam ahi ngeite in na vanh uh hong suttol kik tu hi,” hong cisak hi. Hi bangin hong pian tak ciang Vaanglianbelpa Topa in kei hong puak hunlam a kuama po in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem mite awng, lungdamin lasa vun! Note sungah a teang tu in kong pai hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun ciang minam tam mama Topa kungah pai tu a, ama mite suak tu uh hi. Ama in note sungah hong teang tu a, no kungah kei hong puak hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah mite khatvei ma ama ngam thiangtho sungah Topa ii nei tuam hong hi kik tu a, Jerusalem khua sia ama itbel khuapi hong hi kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama sia a teenna mun thiangtho panin hong pai ahiciang mi theampo awng, Topa mai ah thim dide in om vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mukholna dang khat ah Topa in Thiampi Lianbel Joshua sia Topa vantunglalang mai ah dingin a om hong lak hi. Tuaciang Joshua kungah Satan ding a, ama mawsuan tu in kinging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa vantunglalang in Satan munah, “ Topa in nang hong puavawk tahen, Satan awng! Jerusalem a it Topa in nang hong puavawk tahen. Hi sia pa in meikhuk sung pan a kiteen kik thingkhua khat taw kibang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua in puansiate silhin tualai ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantunglalang in a vantung sawllamhte munah, “Hi sia pa ii a silh puansia teng suutkeak vun,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Joshua munah “Na mawna teng kong laak keaksak zo a, na silh tu puan thakte kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a sawllamhte munah, Joshua lu tungah dial thiang khat a khipsak natu in thupia hi. Tuabang ma in amate in seam uh a, Topa vantunglalang ii din sung teng ma in puan thakte ama kisilhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantunglalang in Joshua tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii ci teng son hi: “Ka thukhamte zui in kong sawl tuamte na seam le, tuasia ciang ka Biakinnpi le a suumte na uk suak tu hi, tuaciang ka omna munah a om vantunglalangte thungetna ka zaak bangin na thungetnate kong za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang nang, Thiampi Lianbel ahi Joshua awng, na ngai in; no, a thiampi seppuite awng, mailam hun phate ii limlakna ahite awng, ngai vun: Thingbaak a kici ka naseampa kong pualaak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joshua mai ah mai sali a nei suang khat nguak ka koi tu hi. Tua tungah lai kong khen tu a, ni khat thu in hi ngam ii mawna teng ka lakeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni hong thet ciang, note khatsim in na sapitkungte le na theikungte taw a kidimna sungah kilemna le ngal muanna nga tu in hong pai natu na innpaamte tek na sam tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hong pau pupui ngei tua vantunglalang sia hong pai kik a, a mu kimlai phok bang phetin kei hong phong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bang na mu ziam?” ci in hong dongh hi. “Khamh taw a kivawt meivak khuam khat hi. A dawn ah sathau koina kuang khat om hi. Meivak khuam tungah meiinn sali om a, a simin meivakkhau koina nei tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meivak khuam lang le lang ah olive thingkung khat veve om hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantunglalang munah, “Topa awng, hite ii khiakna bang ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “He ngawl ni ziam?” hong ci hi. “He ngawl khi hi, topa awng,” ci in ka zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantunglalang in Topa tung pan hong pai hi thu teng Zerubbabel tungah son tu in kei hong sawl hi: “Nangma in ngalkap thahatna hang hi ngawl, nangma thahatna hang hi ngawl, ahihang keima thaa bek taw na ma na tun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mualte za in a lian hong khak hong hal haksatnate na mai panin mang tu hi. Biakinnpi na sa kik tu hi, tuaciang suang khakbel sia a om natu sanah na cian ciang mite in ‘Hoi hi, Hoi hi!’ ci in au tu uh hi,” ama in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa tung panin thupuak dang khat kei tung hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Zerubbabel in Biakinnpi tawdap phaa zo a, a inn sak zo thiang tu hi. Tuabang hong pian ciang, nang sia keima ii amate kungah kong paisak na hi hunlam ka mite in hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vantunglalang in, “Meiinn salite in leitung theampo a mu Topa mittang salite ahi hi,” hong ci hi. Nasepna sungah khantona tawm mama ahiciang amate thinkiam hi. Ahihang amate in Zerubbabel ii Biakinnpi sak tu a zop tawtona a mu uh ciang, a lungdam tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in, “Meivak khuam lang le lang ah a om olive kungte nii in bang a cinopna ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Olive thau sunna khamh lawng niite pangh ah olive baak niite sia bang a cinopna ziam?” ci in ama ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “He ngawl ni ziam?” hong ci hi. “He bong, Topa awng” ci in ka zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ama in, “Hite in leitung bup ii Topa na a seam tu in Pathian tealsa le sathau a noisa mihing niite ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khua ka et kik le vui sungah laizial leang khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantunglalang in ka mu sia hong dongh hi. “Laizial khat vui sungah leang hi; tuasia metre kua sau a, metre li le lang zai hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in kei tungah, “Tuasia tungah ngam bup sungah a tung tu haamsiatna ki at hi. A laizial langkhat ah ngamsung panin nguta a minpiang kinotkeak tu hi; a langkhat ah kiciamna taw leilot thu a son theampo zongh kikaikeak tu hi, ci in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in tua haamsiatna ka tungsak tu a, tuasia in nguta pawpo ii inn le, kiciamna taw leilot thuson pawpo ii inn te sungah tum tu hi ci hi. Tua haamsiatna sia amate inn sungah teang tu a, tua innte a lalcipsa in kinusia tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantunglalang kilangh kik a, “En in! Na dang khat hong pai hi!” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Bang ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi. Ama in, “Tuasia khum khat hi a, ngam bup ii mawna a lakna hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum sitna sia haak taw kivawt hi. Ka et le, a sitna hong kilaamto a, tua khum sungah numei khat to hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantunglalang in, “Hi numei in ngitlona lak hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang ama in tua numei sia khum sungah hensuk in, a sitna taw sin kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka etto ciang hilniang vacimlian ii thate bangin, a hat thate taw keima sangah hong leang numei nii ka mu hi. Amate in khum hong zamh a, lenpui vingveng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vantunglalang tungah, “Amate in tuasia koisungah paipui tu ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Tuasia atu in biakinn khat a saksak natu mun Babylon ah kipaipui tu hi. Biakinn sak a kiman ciang, a biak tu in a sungah tua khum kikoi tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mukholna dang khat ma ka nei hi. Tusia hun ciang taau mual nii kilaklaw pan siphu ngalleang li hong pusuak ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siphu ngalleang khatna sia siphu sante, a niina sia siphu vomte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a thumna sia siphu kaangte, a lina sia siphu pawl tiptepte in kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang vantunglalang munah, “Topa awng, hi siphu ngalleangte ii a khiakna bang ziam?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Hite sia vui lite hi a; tuate in leitung bup ii Topa omna pan hong pai tawm hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siphu vomte ii kai leang sia saksang Babylon zuan tu a, siphu kaangte nitumna sang zuan tu hi, siphu pawl tiptepte thangsang ngam zuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siphu pawl tiptepte hong pusua ciangin leitung enkot nuam kisa in a pai tu kaal ngakla uh hi. Vantunglalang in, “Pai vun a, leitung enkot tavun!” ci a — tuaciang tuate pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantunglalang in hong oksan a, “Saksang Babylon ah a pai siphute in Topa thin uukna thimsak zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in hi thu hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “Saltaangte ahi Heldai, Tobijah le Jedaiah te ii piak letsongte la in Zephaniah tapa Josiah inn ah thakhat ma pai in. Hi mite Babylon ah a saltanna pan hong heak kik siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate hong piak khamh le ngunn te taw kumpilukhu khat vawt in a, Jehozadak tapa Thiampi Lianbel Joshua lu tungah khusak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, ‘Thingbaak a kici mihing khat ama omna munah khangto tu a, Topa Biakinnpi sa kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia a sa tu sia ama hi a, kumpi khat patoai natu a kilawm teng ama in tangin, a mite uk tu hi. Thiampi khat ama kumpi tokhum kungah ding tu a, amate in kilemna le kituiton natu seam khawm tu hi,’ a ci teng ama munah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua kumpilukhu in, Heldai, Tobijah, Jedaiah le Josiah te upatna le phawk natu in Topa Biakinnpi sungah om tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khuala ah a teang mite hong pai tu a, Topa Biakinnpi sakkikna ah hong hu tu hi. A sakkik sia a man ciang, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in kei sia nang kungah hong paisak hunlam na he tu hi. Topa na Pathian hong thupiak teng na zui le hi thu teng theampo hong piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius sia kumpilianpa in a maan zawk a kum lina, a tha kuana (Kislev tha), a ni li ni in Topa in kei tungah thu khat hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel mite in Sharezer le, Regemmelech le a mite sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa Biakinnpi ah Topa thupha dei in thungen tu le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thiampite le kamsaangte tungah hi bangin thu dongh tu in paisak hi, “Biakinnpi a kilalsak hu in kum tam mama sung ka vawt sa uh bangma, tu in a tha nga tha in, an tanna taw khuangai in om lai tu khu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thu sia Topa ii thupuak hi a, kei tungah hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Ngamsung a mite le thiampite ii hi kum sawmsali sung tawntung a tha ngana le a tha sali na ah khuangai in an a tan uh ciang kei hong patoai ahi ngawlna sia amate tungah son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a neak a dawn ciang amate lungkim natu bek ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi thu in Jerusalem khangto a, mihing taw a kidim hun lai, mihing tam mamate tua khuapi kiim a om khuate sung bek ah teang ngawlin thangsang ngamkhen le nitumna sang mualpeang te zongh ah a teen hun lai pekin kamsaang masate tungtawn a, Topa ii sonsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Zechariah tungah hi thu puak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Khua ngeipi lai in ka mite munah hi thupiakte ka pia hi: ‘Thukhaikim in seam vun a, khat le khat dikna le kihesuakna nei hamtang tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No sungah hong teang ngamdangmite, meingong tangate ahizong, a cimaw dangte ahizong, zothaw ngawl tu nu hi. Khat le khat kisuksiat natu a nanamin sawm ngawl tu nu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahihang ka minamte thinpui in hong nangai ngawl uh hi. Amate in a thinsung kongkhate khakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a lungtangte suang bangin saksak uh hi. Khua ngeipi lai a kamsaangte tungtawn a ka hil thute ngai nuam ngawl ahikom, ka thin uuk mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pau ciang hong ngai ngawl uh ahikom, thu hong nget uh ciang ka zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate ngamdang ah a teang tu in, vuipi suangval bangin ka niil keak hi. Hi ngampha na sungah a teang om ngawl a, ngamtongta in kinusia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Zechariah tungah hi thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A mite ka it mama manin Jerusalem ka hu tu kaal ka ngakla hi, tua itna in a ngalte tungah hong thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka khuapi thiangtho Jerusalem ah ka cia kik tu a, tualai ah ka teang tu hi. Tua khuapi sia a citak khuapi kici tu a, Vaanglianbelpa Topa mual sia a thiangtho mual kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatvei ma, nupi huai pasal huaite, huai leilam kisa in ciangkhut khunin a vakte sia khuapi khawlmunte ah to tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang lampite sia a kimai numeino patangno te taw kidim kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tu in minam sungah a om laite atu in hi thu sia suak thei ngawl tu bang hikale kei atu in suak maw ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite a kilaakna ngamte pan ka suatak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a teang tu in nisuana le nitumna panin amate ka paipui kik tu hi. Tuaciang amate ka mi hi tu a, keima in amate thumaan le thutang taw a uk a Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hangsan vun! Ka Biakinnpi sa kik tu in, a tawdap a kipha lai hunin kamsaangte pau kammal teng ma, tu in na za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hun masia in kuama in mihing ahizong nganhing ahizong tha cial zo ngawl a, a ngalte kung pan kuama ngammuang ngawl hi. Mihingte khat le khat ka kilangpansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang tu in, hi minam sung pan a nungta laite sia a tuamin ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in thinnuam takin lo ante ciing tu hi. A sapitkungte hong nga tu a, leitang in ante piangsak in, ngua tam mama hong zu tu hi. Hi thuphate theampo ka minam sung pan a nungta lai ka mite tungah ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah le Israel mite awng! Hun bosa sungah ngamdangmite khat le khat, a kihaamsiat uh ciangin ‘Judah le Israel mite tungah a tung tuasiatnate ma no tungah hong tung tahen’ kici uh hi. Ahihang note kong hun tu a, tuaciang tua ngamdangmite khat le khat in, ‘Judah le Israel te tungah a theng thuphate ma nga tavun!’ kici tu uh hi. Tua ahikom hangsan vun a, lau heak vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Na taanghpupite ii hong thin uuksak ciang, amate tuasiatsak tu ka sawm a, ka thin kheal kik ngawlin ka ngeal bangin ka seam suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang tu in Jerusalem le Judah mite thupha piak ka sawm hi. Tua ahikom lau heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sep tu uh sia hi teng hi: Khat le khat tungah thumaan thutak kison vun. Thukhenzum ah thutang khenna tatak — kilemna a piangsak thukhenna namte pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khat le khat kinatsak tu tum heak vun. Kiciamna taw leilot tetti pang heak vun. Leilotna, thukhaikim ngawl thukhenna le ngongtatna ka ngaimaw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Zechariah tungah hi thu pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“A tha li tha, a tha nga tha, a tha sali tha le a tha sawm tha te sungah antan nate sia Judah mite atu in lungdam thinnop poai hong suak tu hi. Thumaan thutak le kilemna dei hamtang vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Khuapi tam mamate pan mite Jerusalem ah a pai tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuapi khat pan hong pai mite in khuapi dang pan hong pai mite tungah ‘Ko Vaanglianbelpa Topa bia tu le ama thupha nga natu thungen tu in pai tu khu hi. Ko taw hong paikhawm tavun!’ kici tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihing tam mama le minam a hat mamate sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa bia tu le ama thupha nga natu thungen tu in Jerusalem ah pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun ciang, ngamdangmi sawm in Judah mi khat kungah hong pai tu a, ‘Note taw Pathian om hi ci in za ka hi uh ciang note taw a sia a pha kumkhawm nuam khu hi, ci tu uh hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu in Topa ii thupuak ahi hi: Ama in Hadrach ngam le Damascus khuapi tungah daan piakna thutan zo hi. Israel namte bek hi ngawlin Syria khuapi zongh Topa neisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hadrach taw a kingamngi Hamath zongh ama ii neisa ahi bangma, Tyre le Sidon khuapite le a khut thiamna te theampo zongh ama ii neisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tyre in ama atu in khuapi kulhpite vawt a, ngunn le khamhte a kholsa tam leilam ahiciangin leivui bang bek hi lel hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang a neisa theampo Topa in laak keaksak tu hi. Topa in a nei a lamh teng tuipi sungah vawksak tu a, tua khuapi kihaltum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ashkelon khuapi in hi teng mu in lau tu hi. Gaza khuapi in tuasia mu in na sa mama tu hi. Ekron zongh tuabang ma hi tu a, a lametnate bo tu hi. Gaza in a kumpi taan tu a, Ashkelon sia kitaisan in kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minam kihel mite in Ashdod ah teang tu uh hi. Topa in, “Tua a kiphasak Philistine te theampo ka niamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in chi baanglai sate ahibuale a kikhaam an dangte ne nawn ngawl tu uh hi. A nungta laite theampo ka mite ii khen khat suak tu a, Judah nam sungah bee le phung khat in om tu hi. Ekron sia Jebus te bangma in ka mite suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngam ka cing tu a, ngalkaphonpite in ka kaantansak buatu hi. Kumpi ngilote in ka mite ka zothawsak nawn buatu hi. Ka mite thuakna sa teng mu zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungdam vun, lungdam vun, Zion mite awng! No Jerusalem mite awng, lungdam in au vun! En vun, na kumpipa no kungah hong pai hi! Ama in ngalzawna mualsua in lungdamna taw hong pai hi, Ahihang kiniamkhiak in laa khat — Laano, laatal no khat tungah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngal siphu leangte Israel pan ka heam tu a, Jerusalem pan siphute ka la tu hi; Ngal kisimna sung a kizangh thalte ka lalsak tu hi. Na kumpipa in minam tuatuamte sungah kilemna omsak tu hi; ama in tuipi khat pan tuipi khat dong, Euphrates ngun pan leitung mong dong uk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Sangaw biakpiakna chisan taw a kikipsak ka thuciamna hangin na saltanna mun, tui om ngawlna dum sung pan note kong suaktasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu in lametna a nei no, saltaangte awng, heak kik vun; na ngam muanna munah heak kik tavun. Na thuakna sa theampo hangin a zaa nii in thupha kong piak kik natu thu, tu in note tungah kong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in Judah sia ngalkap khat ii thal bangin, Israel sia thaltangte bangin ka zangh tu hi. Greece mite do tu in Zion pasalte sia namsau khat bangin ka zangh tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah hong kilangh tu hi; ama in a thaltangte khualeng bangin kap tu hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in a lemle tum tu a; thangsang pan vuipi suangval bangin hong kuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in a mite sungsia tu hi, tuaciang amate in a ngalte susia tu uh hi. Amate sia ngal kisimna sungah zukhamte bangin au in, a ngalte chisan luangsak tu uh hi; tua chisan sia biaknatau tungah beal sung pan a kisung sangaw biakpiakna khat ii chi bangin luang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni ciangin, tuucingpa in a tuute launa pan a huuk bangin, Topa in a mite hun tu hi. Amate in ama ngam sungah kumpilukhu tungah a suang manphate bangin taang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ngam sia bangza in pha a et hoi tu ziam! Khangnote in tua ngam pan a piang thaw an le sapittui neakna taw a thahat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khaal kipat hunin Topa tungah nguatui ngen vun. Ngua a paai meeikaai hong puak a, ngua zusak in, kuama theampo atu lote a hingsak pa sia Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite in milimte le aisaan theite thu dongh ahihang a zo kiknate sia leilot thu le luithawthong thu veu hi. Pawl khat in mangkhia a, ahihang tuate in nang hong lampialsak bek hi; amate hong piak thinnopna in man nei ngawl hi. Tua ahikom tuu bote bangin tua mite vakthap uh hi. Amate in lampui nei ngawl ahikom ngim nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite a uk ngamdangmite tungah ka thin uuk a, daan ka pia tu hi. Judah mite sia keima aa hi, tuaciang keima Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate ka keam tu hi. Amate sia a thahat ka ngal siphute hong hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sung panin ka mite a uk tu ngamukte, lampuite le ngalkap maangte hong piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah mite in a ngalte lampi buan sungah a siikcil ngalkapte bangin ngalzo tu uh hi. Topa in amate panpui ahiciang amate in ngalsim tu uh hi, amate in a ngalte siphu ngalkapte ngawngawn zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keima in Judah mite ka hatsak tu hi; Israel mite ka suatak tu hi. Keima in amate khuangaihuai ka sa tu a, a vekpi in inn ah ka ciapui kik tu hi. Amate sia ka nial ngeingawl mite bang hi tu hi. Keima in Topa, a Pathian ka hi hi; A thungetnate ka zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngalkapte bangin Israel mite thahat tu uh hi. Sapittui ne te bangin lungdam tu uh hi. Topa nasepna hangin a suan a paalte in hi zawna phawk in, lungdam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka mite ka sam tu a, ka kaikhawm tu hi. Amate ka suatak tu a, a ngei bangin ka tamsak mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minam tuatuamte sungah amate thethaang hi kaleng, a khualana pan ngawngawn in kei hong phawk tu uh hi. Amate le a tate nungta lai tu a, inn ah cia khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt le Assyria panin amate inn ah ka ciapui tu a, amate ii mun le ngam ah ka teangsak tu hi. Amate Gilead le Lebanon zongh ah ka teangsak tu hi; ngam bup sia mihing taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ngimna tuipi a kaan uh ciang, keima Topa in tuihualte ka saat tu a, Nile ngun thuk nate ko tu hi. A kiphasak Assyria kiniamsuksak tu a, a thahat Egypt in a thahatna taan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in ka mite ka hatsak tu hi; amate in kei hong bia tu a, ka thu hong mang tu hi,” ci hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lebanon awng, mei in na cedar thingkungte a kaktum thei natu in na kongkhate hong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cypress thingkungte awng, kapin tau vun — cedar thingte puk zo hi; tua thingkung minthangte kisusia zo hi! Bashan oak thingkungte awng, kapin tau vun — taamthing zingte kiphuk zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngam ukte khuangai in kap hi; amate minthanna bo zo hi! Tawpite hawk ngai vun: Jordan ngundung, amate ii teenna duithuk sia kisusia zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian in kei tungah, “Ngaw tu a kikoi tuu honte a cingpa bang hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua tuute sia a tote in that a, a thatte daan kipia ngawl hi. Amate in a sa zuakin, ‘ Topa pok vun! Ei hau zo hing!’ ci hi. A tuucingte ngawngawn in hesuakna nei ngawl uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Topa in, “Leitung ah kuama hesuak nawn ngawl tu khi hi. Keima mama in a ukte khut sungah mi theampo ka koi tu hi. Hi ngamukte in leitung siacipsak tu a, amate thahatna panin tua leitung ka suatak buatu hi,” ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuu a lei, a zuakte in kei hong cial a, kei sia a kingo tu tuute a cingpa ka suak hi. Ciangkang nii ka la a: khat sia “Maipha piakna” ka ci a, a dang khat sia ‘Kilomkhatna’ ka ci hi. Tuaciang tuuhonte ka cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei hong ensan tuucing dang thumte tungah ka thin a sau zo bua hi, amate teng sia tha khat sungin ka tawpsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tuuhonte tungah, “No ii tuucing pa hi nawn ngawl tu khi hi. A thi tu teng thi vun a, a kisusia tu teng kisusia hen. A taanglai teng in amate khat le khat kisucip ta uh hen,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ‘Maipha piakna’ a kici ciangkang la in, Topa ii minam theampo taw a vawt thuciamna phiat na tu in tuasia ka thiaktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua thuciamna sia, tua ni in kiphiat hi, tuu a zuak le a leite in kei hong en nginge a, ka sep ka vawtte tungtawnin Topa in thuson ahi hunlam he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate tungah, “Na uuk uh le ka thaman hong pia tavun. Na uuk bua uh le noma tang vun,” ka ci hi. Tua ahikom amate in ka thaman tu in ngunntang sawmthum hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, keima tungah “Tua sumte biakinn sumkholna ah koi ta'n hong ci hi. Tua ahikom ngunntang 30 — kei taw kiphu a sak a tam mama sum — tua teng la in biakinn sumkholna ah ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ‘Kilomkhatna’ a kici ciangkang niina sia ka thiaktan a, Judah le Israel kilomkhatna kitamhtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in keima tungah, “Khatvei ma tuucingpa heang leleau in a, tutung sia a mannung ngawl tuucingpa in, kiheang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tuuhonte uk tu in tuucing khat ka koi hi, ahihang ama in lalna a thuak tu tuute le huu ngawl a; a bote le zong ngawl, a liamte le bawl ngawl, a ciidamte zongh anvaak ngawl hi. Tuabang a sep tu luangin ama in tuu a thaubelte ii sa ne in a peangcinte khok keak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua a mannung ngawl tuucingpa a lal hi zo hi! Ama in a tuuhonte nusia zo hi. Ama thahatna sia ngalte in lalcipsak tu hi. A baan ngawtaak tu a, a mit ziatsang taw tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thupuak in Israel taw kisai vante a phalh, lei a bitphua, mihing nuntakna a pia Topa tung pan ahi hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jerusalem sia sapittui hai khat bangin ka vawt tu hi; a kiimkot a minam tuatuamte in ne tu a, zu kham bangin hoi vatut tu uh hi. Amate in Jerusalem a uumci uh ciangin, Judah khuapi dangte zongh ki uumci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang tua hun hong thet ciang, Jerusalem sia a ngit suangtum pui khat bangin ka vawt tu a — tuasia laamto tu a kipan minam pawpo liam tu hi. Leitung minam theampo kipawlin ama sim tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun ciang a siphute theampo ka lausak tu a, a tung to teng ka mawmawsak tu hi. Judah mite ka encik tu hi, ahihang a ngalte ii siphute a mit ka tawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Judah bee le phungte in amate le amate tungah, ‘Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Jerusalem ah a teang a mite thahatna pia hi’ kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua hun ciang Judah bee le phungte duisung ahibuale, thaw an min lak pha lo sung a meikaang bangin ka vawt tu hi — amate in a kiimkot minamte theampo susia tu uh hi. Jerusalem mite ahile khuapi sungah ngammuangin om tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Keima, Topa in Judah ngalkaphonpite zawna ka pia masa tu hi, tua hile David suan le paalte le Jerusalem mite ii a nga tu patoaina sia a taanglai Judah mite nga tu patoaina sangin lian zaw ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Topa in Jerusalem a teangte dal tu a, amate sungah a thazawm belte ngawngawn David bangin hat tu uh hi. David suan le paalte in Topa ii vantunglalang bang ahizong Pathian mama bang ahizong amate lampui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Jerusalem sim tu a kipan minam theampo ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keima in David suan le paalte le Jerusalem a teang a dangte sia hesuakna thin le thungetna thin taw ka dimh tu hi. Amate in nam taw a tuplup pa en tu uh a, ta khat bek a nei a thisuate khuangai bangin khuangai tu uh hi. Amate in a tapaciil a khuaite bangin nasia tak khuangai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua laitakin Jerusalem ah heena kaana sia Megiddo zaangtam a Hadad-rimmon atu heena le kaana za in nasia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngamsung innkuan simin khuangai in om tek tu hi: David suante innkuan, Nathan suante innkuan, Levi suante innkuan, Shimei suante innkuan, a dang innkuante hi siat tu hi. Ngamsung innkuan simin khuangai tek in a om ciang, pate ahile numeite taw kihel ngawlin a tuamin khuangai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in “Tua hun hong thet ciang, David suan le paalte le Jerusalem mite mawna le milim biakna pan thiansua natu in tuinaak khat hong phuul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hun ciang ngamsung pan milimte min theampo ka phiat tu a, kuama in ciamtee nawn ngawl tu hi. Kamsaang ka hi a ci khat pawpo le, milim biak tu a lungngulna ka heam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang khat po in kamsaanna a zom nuam hamtang lai le, a pa le a nu in nang hong kithatlum nanak tu hi, ci tu hi, ama in Topa ii kammalte ka pau ci napi, leilot thu a son hang ahi hi. Ama ii kam a san ciang, a pa le a nu in nam taw hollum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang kamsaang kuama in a mukholna hu in kiphasak ngawl tu a, kamsaang khat bangin ngamta ngawlin, kamsaangte puan hampuite ngualtheam natu in silh ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua taangin ama in, ‘Kei kamsaang hi bong. Kei lothopa khi hi — ka khan tawntung lo ka tho hi’ ci zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang khat po in, ‘Na awm a liammate bang ziam?’ ci in a dongh le ‘Lawmte khat ii inn pan ka nga hi’ ci in zo tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Namsau awng, khanglo in kei atu a seam tuucingpa sim ta'n! Ama thatlum in, tuaciang tuute kithethaang tu hi. Ka mite ka sim tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaciang, ngam bup sungah mihingte see thum sua see nii thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nungta lai khen thum sua khen khat teng ka sit tu a, meikuang taw ngunnte a kithiansak bangin amate ka thiangsak tu hi. Khamh a kisit bangin amate ka sit tu hi. Tuaciang amate in thungen tu a, keima in ka zo tu hi. Amate tungah ka mite ahi hunlam ka son tu a, amate in keima Pathian ka hi hunlam pualaak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia thukhenin a to tu ni nai zo hi. Tuaciang Jerusalem kiphuul tu a, na mu tangin a vanh laakte kihawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem sim tu in minam theampo khawmtua tu hi. Khuapi kila in, innte kiphuul tu a, numeite buan in khialpui tu hi. Khua mite a lang sia sal in kipaipui tu a, a taanglai teng ahile khuapi pan kipaipui ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, nidang lai in a sim ngei bangma in Topa kuanin tua minamte sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Jerusalem nisuana sang Olive mual tungah ama ding tu hi. Tuaciang Olive Mual sia nisuana sang pan nitumna sangah phel nii in kikhen a kuam lian khat om tu hi. Mual a lang sia saksangah kikhiin tu a, a lang sia thang sangah kikhiin tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mual khen nii in a khen, tua kuam kaantanin no na suakta tu uh hi. Judah kumpipa Uzziah hunsung zinliin lai in, na taanghpupite tai bangin na tai tu uh hi. Topa ka Pathian in vantunglalang theampo hong pai pui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang, khuasik, ahibuale thuamluak
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />le khuazing cite om nawn ngawl tu hi. Zan ngawngawn in khuavak top tu hi. Topa bekin hisia a pian tu hun he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ni hong thet ciang, Jerusalem pan tui thiang hong luang tu a, a lang sia Tuipi Thi ah, a lang sia Mediterranean tuipi ah luang tu hi. Tua tui sia tuk taw khaal taw kum tawntungin, luang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa sia leitung theampo ii kumpipa in hong mang tu a; ama ii Pathian sia a kuama po in bia tu a, tua min taw ma in ama he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saksang Geba panin thangsang Rimmon dong ngamkuam buppi leitam kisua tu hi. Jerusalem sia kiim le paamte sangin saangzaw tu hi; khuapi in Benjamin kongpi pan nidang kongpi omna ngei Kiing Kongpi dong, tuaciang Hananel Tausaang pan kumpite sapittui suuknate dongin kithung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte tua munah ngam muangin teang tu a, siatna in a lauthawn nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem a sim minamte theampo tungah a kiitak huai mama natna tungsak tu hi. Amate nungta nginge lai in a sa uh muat tu hi; a mitte le a leeite muatcip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Topa in amate lungmangsak biaibuai in lausak tu a, a kuama po in a kungah a om khat pawpo zamhin ngal vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah mite in Jerusalem a huu tu in ngaldo tu uh hi. Amate in minam theampo ii nei le lamh — khamh, ngunn le puan tam mamate laaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kiitak huai mama natna khat sia ngalte ngiaphual a om nganhingte theampo — siphute, laate, kalaohte, laano namte tung zongh ah tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jerusalem khua a sim minamte sung pan a nungta laite theampo sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa bia tu le Buk Poai khaam tu in kum simin Jerusalem ah pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minam khat pawpo in Vaanglianbelpa Topa sia kumpi bangin biak tu a nial le amate ngam ah nguazu ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt te in tua Buk Poai khaam tu a nial le, tua poai khaam tu a nial pawpo tung ah Topa ii puak tua natna sia ma taw daan thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua Buk Poai a khaam nuam ngawl Egypt te le minam dangte tungah hi natna daan tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun ciangin siphu ngawlokte tung ngawngawn ah “ Topa atu Kitavaw” ci kammalte ki at lai tu hi. Biakinn sung a an huanna bealte zongh biaknatau mai a kuangte bangma in thiangtho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem le Judah ngam bup sung a an huanna beal theampo sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa biakna a zak tu in kituam koi tu hi. Sangaw biakpiakna a pia mite in tua bealte biakpiakna sate huanna in zangh tu hi. Tua hun hong thet ciang Vaanglianbelpa Topa Biakinnpi sungah sumvawtte khat zong om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
</usx>
